  "pt_diagnosis_note": "exp3505 PT underperformance root cause: n_exchange_interval was set to n_sweeps//5+1, yielding only ~4 total replica-exchange attempts per puzzle (401 interval with 2000 sweeps for easy tier). With ~4 proposals, chains had virtually no opportunity to mix \u2014 PT degraded to 4 independent restarts with no inter-chain communication, explaining the below-SA solve rate. | Tuned ladder (n_exchange_interval=50, n_chains=6, T_min=0.1, T_max=2.0): mean_swap_acceptance=0.631, tuned_pt_solve_rate=0.450 (vs exp3505 pt_solve_rate=0.381). Fix confirmed: tuned PT >= original PT.",
  "ar_greedy_solve_rate": 0.0,
  "ar_literature_baselines_note": "exp3505 parallel_tempering_solve_rate=0.381 (8 of 21 puzzles, easy/medium/hard only). Sudoku-Bench arXiv:2505.16135: SOTA LLMs solve <15% unaided. Kona EBM (Logical Intelligence): 96.2% vs frontier LLMs ~2% on hard Sudoku. BDH (Pathway arXiv:2024): 97.4% on Sudoku Extreme vs leading LLMs ~0%. These literature numbers make the AR=0.0 greedy baseline conservative (real LLMs also fail near 0% on hard/extreme boards).",
